# Only the default MaterialX version ships in the .vsix — the Compare
# view (the only feature that needs extra versions) isn't in the
# webview nav. The default is computed in scripts/lib/mtlx-versions.mjs
# (DEFAULT_MTLX_VERSION); update this line if that ever changes.
js/materialx/1.39.4/**

# embed/ (the <materialx-viewer> web-embed bundle: embed/gen/*.js,
# embed/mtlx-viewer.js, embed/viewer.html, embed/embed.css) is a
# web-only distribution path. The webview always loads index.html's own
# view scripts and never references anything under embed/, so bundling
# it here would just be ~370 KB of dead weight in the .vsix.
embed/**
